# pc64 - canonical O-only storage/boot plus raw Ethernet devices.
#
# Combines native O storage and boot with raw L2 Ethernet drivers only.  The
# legacy #l/#I/#W registrations, compiled IPv4 paths, kernel IPv6/ARP/ESP
# protocol stack and all network boot services are removed.  The common
# Device ABI exclusively claims raw NIC RX through a capability region ring.
# There is no Dev registry and no swap Dev: Plan2001-O has no swap
# partition, file, device or anonymous pageout, and no legacy Dev front
# doors.  The native framebuffer text console and the raw PS/2 keyboard
# are direct kernel services.
